add('continualvln','method','SUPPLEMENT CHECK: pp. 2–4 specify A3C plus imitation CE, batch eight, 4,000/5,000 iterations per domain on an A100. PerpR sorts new episodes by descending action perplexity and evicts low-perplexity stored episodes under a domain quota. ESR replays the stored logit-argmax action sequence to revisit corresponding states, then distills current versus stored logits while also using ground-truth action labels. The pseudocode shorthand applying a loss to argmax should not be interpreted as a differentiable literal CE formula; the text describes CE supervision.')
n['continualvln']['implementation']='No official implementation was located in the bounded search of the exact title, author names, supplied paper and official BMVC 2025 proceedings page as of 2026-10-22. The official supplementary ZIP was accessible and its six-page PDF was read in full; it provides algorithms, losses, schedules and benchmark details but not inspected model source. Consequently model/training/runtime equivalence cannot be checked and benchmark reproduction is not claimed.'
n['continualvln']['repo_status']='Official repository not located in bounded exact-title/author/proceedings search; official algorithm supplement reviewed.'
